Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: if gauged from last year's budget appropriation.

asr-000287
00:31:51.170 --> 00:31:55.470
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: For our major final outputs, Your Honor,

asr-000288
00:31:55.470 --> 00:31:57.870
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: or case disposition, the following slides

asr-000289
00:31:57.870 --> 00:32:04.310
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: represent disposition from the Supreme Court down to our first-level courts.

asr-000290
00:32:04.310 --> 00:32:14.110
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: From the data, many of our courts are already exceeding their disposal targets with accomplishment rates reaching 85% to 290%.

asr-000291
00:32:14.110 --> 00:32:28.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: With our first-level courts being our champions in case disposition, considering the volume of cases incoming and the 24-hour limit in the disposal of cases with the application of the rules and expedited procedures in the first-level courts.

asr-000292
00:32:28.390 --> 00:32:34.570
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The figures, however, Your Honor, only represent productivity and not the entirety of the performance.

asr-000293
00:32:35.050 --> 00:32:40.830
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Because under the SPJI, the Supreme Court has begun to pilot the high-performance courts framework.

asr-000294
00:32:41.370 --> 00:32:49.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Instead of just the number, it looks at internal processes, decision quality, court user satisfaction, and employee engagement.

asr-000295
00:32:49.390 --> 00:32:58.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: In that sense, the high-performance court, Your Honors, is the next evolution of our performance measurement from volume of output to decrement.

asr-000296
00:32:58.390 --> 00:33:01.450
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Quality and overall effectiveness of justice delivery.

asr-000297
00:33:01.910 --> 00:33:09.110
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So we are moving from measuring how much a court does to understanding how well a court delivers justice.

asr-000298
00:33:09.550 --> 00:33:26.890
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Your Honors, also another important component of our effort to improve court performance, which will affect case disposition, is the continuing professionalization and decentralization of court administration through the Office of the Regional Court Managers, or ORCMs.

asr-000299
00:33:26.890 --> 00:33:28.170
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The objective is to...

asr-000300
00:33:28.390 --> 00:33:41.130
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Allow our courts to focus on their core mandate in the adjudication and disposition of cases, while administrative and operational requirements are increasingly supported through a dedicated court management structure.

asr-000301
00:33:41.670 --> 00:33:45.370
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So this directly supports our high-performance courts initiative.

asr-000302
00:33:45.370 --> 00:33:50.050
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: A high-performance court should not only dispose of cases efficiently.

asr-000303
00:33:50.510 --> 00:33:58.370
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: It should have the administrative support systems that enable judges and court personnel to devote more of their time and attention to their primary...

asr-000304
00:33:58.390 --> 00:33:59.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: judicial functions.

asr-000305
00:33:59.390 --> 00:34:07.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Now, for our SPJI reforms, Your Honor, we likewise listed our milestones for our... for 2026.

asr-000306
00:34:07.390 --> 00:34:25.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Your Honors, we have always invoked that the SPJI is our roadmap for transforming the judiciary, not only through technology, but through improvements in the way courts are managed, cases are processed, resources are administered, and services are delivered to the public.

asr-000307
00:34:25.390 --> 00:34:27.590
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: What we present in these slides are milestones of the SPJI reform.

asr-000308
00:34:27.590 --> 00:34:28.110
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Thank you.

asr-000309
00:34:28.110 --> 00:34:30.930
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: And now we would like to thank the Office of the Regional Court Managers for their holistic participation in this program.

asr-000310
00:34:30.930 --> 00:34:38.670
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: They demonstrate that the judiciary has already moved from planning to actual implementation across a broad range of areas.

asr-000311
00:34:39.150 --> 00:34:48.170
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: These initiatives include the eCourt PH, the eCourt, and the Philippine Judiciary Platform, which support the digitalization of court processes.

asr-000312
00:34:48.710 --> 00:34:56.290
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The AI system of voice-to-text transcription, which is listed as number one, which can assist in the preparation of transcripts and court records.

asr-000313
00:34:56.290 --> 00:34:57.730
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We likewise have the development...

asr-000314
00:34:58.110 --> 00:35:05.370
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: of the ICT governance framework, the ICT strategic plan, cloud infrastructure, connectivity and data

asr-000315
00:35:05.370 --> 00:35:11.550
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: center capabilities which provide the technological backbone for these reforms. We are likewise

asr-000316
00:35:11.550 --> 00:35:17.130
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: building systems for financial management, human resource management, procurement, electronic

asr-000317
00:35:17.130 --> 00:35:22.730
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: payments, online learning and case and court facility management. These are important because

asr-000318
00:35:22.730 --> 00:35:28.710
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: modernization is not confined to what happens inside the courtroom because it also involves

asr-000319
00:35:28.710 --> 00:35:34.170
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: modernizing the administrative systems that support the courts. We are also developing

asr-000320
00:35:34.170 --> 00:35:40.090
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: initiatives that directly improve access to the justice system including the unified legal aid

asr-000321
00:35:40.090 --> 00:35:46.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: service portal, e-notarization and other online services for the bar and other justice sectors

asr-000322
00:35:46.390 --> 00:35:52.210
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: stakeholders. The significance of these initiatives, your honors, is that they are designed to cascade

asr-000323
00:35:52.210 --> 00:35:52.710
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: beyond the court system. We are also developing initiatives that directly improve access to the

asr-000324
00:35:52.710 --> 00:35:58.570
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Supreme Court and benefit the courts throughout the country. The objective is not to create

asr-000325
00:35:58.570 --> 00:36:04.390
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: isolated technological solutions but to build an integrated judiciary in which information,

