asr-001083
01:18:23.440 --> 01:18:24.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-001084
01:18:25.620 --> 01:18:27.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, good morning.

asr-001085
01:18:27.140 --> 01:18:28.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good morning to all of you.

asr-001086
01:18:29.820 --> 01:18:36.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just like what I have, I received a letter from the DBM.

asr-001087
01:18:38.260 --> 01:18:44.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The first copy of the comment on your proposed 2037 budget, section 3 of RA 12233.

asr-001088
01:18:45.520 --> 01:18:45.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Here it is.

asr-001089
01:18:45.940 --> 01:18:47.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They're recommending a budget ceiling of 77.

asr-001090
01:18:47.820 --> 01:18:54.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 77 billion, which leaves 9 billion, 9.17 billion gap from the judiciaries.

asr-001091
01:18:54.580 --> 01:18:59.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Your proposal is 86 billion, 86.37 billion.

asr-001092
01:18:59.200 --> 01:19:04.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, of course, the basic questions I would like to ask, which specific program or projects

asr-001093
01:19:04.700 --> 01:19:10.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: will strongly be affected of this 9.17 billion difference?

asr-001094
01:19:10.500 --> 01:19:16.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe the DBM, because of the judicial...

asr-001095
01:19:16.200 --> 01:19:17.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Autonomy.

asr-001096
01:19:17.820 --> 01:19:22.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe this is the last chance for them to comment or to intervene.

asr-001097
01:19:23.080 --> 01:19:25.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You know, the DBM, if they can reduce it, they will reduce it.

asr-001098
01:19:26.260 --> 01:19:29.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But because of the low fiscal ceiling also this year.

asr-001099
01:19:30.220 --> 01:19:37.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, specifically, what are the major programs and projects that will be affected by the

asr-001100
01:19:37.400 --> 01:19:39.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 9.17 billion difference?

asr-001101
01:19:40.740 --> 01:19:44.700
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Your Honor, because we're really banking on three factors, Your Honor.

asr-001102
01:19:44.700 --> 01:19:46.700
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Our people, system, and infrastructure.

asr-001103
01:19:47.820 --> 01:19:55.460
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So, if we decrease it by 9 billion, definitely in our people, our plans to upgrade, reclassify

asr-001104
01:19:55.460 --> 01:20:00.380
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: the salaries of our people will be affected.

asr-001105
01:20:00.980 --> 01:20:04.460
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: And most of our personnel, Your Honor, have not had the salary increase.

asr-001106
01:20:05.020 --> 01:20:09.940
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: And because there's no really point of them being promoted, because there's no such thing

asr-001107
01:20:09.940 --> 01:20:10.940
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: in the courts, Your Honor.

asr-001108
01:20:10.940 --> 01:20:16.440
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: If you come in as a utility, the only chance that you can become as that salary grade one,

asr-001109
01:20:16.860 --> 01:20:17.460
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: that the only chance...

asr-001110
01:20:17.820 --> 01:20:21.520
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The only chance that you can be promoted as a process server, considering the qualification

asr-001111
01:20:21.520 --> 01:20:25.640
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: standards that you can, which is SG2, will be second to none.

asr-001112
01:20:25.780 --> 01:20:30.900
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Because most of the time, we are really awaiting for the retirement of most members of our

asr-001113
01:20:30.900 --> 01:20:31.300
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: people.

asr-001114
01:20:31.760 --> 01:20:36.100
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So, if we decrease the infrastructure, can you imagine, Your Honor?

asr-001115
01:20:36.100 --> 01:20:41.560
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: I mean, I cannot even say that our courts are beyond dignified in the image.

asr-001116
01:20:41.920 --> 01:20:43.680
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We really have to do a lot of...

asr-001117
01:20:43.680 --> 01:20:47.800
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Especially, Your Honors, the fact that most of our buildings are 20 years and older.

asr-001118
01:20:47.820 --> 01:20:52.520
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: With the calamities that have been happening, we've been going around, our buildings are

asr-001119
01:20:52.520 --> 01:20:53.820
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: old and do need...

asr-001120
01:20:54.440 --> 01:21:00.140
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: They need rehabilitation, repairs, and a lot of, if not, demolition, Your Honor.

asr-001121
01:21:00.680 --> 01:21:04.820
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: HOJ in Iloilo, Your Honor, I'm not even sure, but it has been vacated.

asr-001122
01:21:05.880 --> 01:21:06.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It has been condemned.

asr-001123
01:21:07.020 --> 01:21:08.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It was retrofitted.

asr-001124
01:21:09.820 --> 01:21:15.020
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, but most of our judges do not feel safe anymore to go back, which is why we had to

asr-001125
01:21:15.020 --> 01:21:17.800
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: relocate them to another one, to another building.

asr-001126
01:21:17.820 --> 01:21:23.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I don't know if it's coincidence, but in Iloilo, when there's a flyover, there's a lot of

asr-001127
01:21:23.540 --> 01:21:23.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: people.

asr-001128
01:21:24.980 --> 01:21:26.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Then, the Hall of Justice, that's new.

asr-001129
01:21:27.400 --> 01:21:32.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Then, it's already unfit for occupancy.

asr-001130
01:21:33.200 --> 01:21:35.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: There's a need to retrofit again.

asr-001131
01:21:35.280 --> 01:21:38.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The flyover that was like a rollercoaster, it was retrofitted.

asr-001132
01:21:39.020 --> 01:21:39.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's new.

asr-001133
01:21:39.840 --> 01:21:41.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Now, it's being retrofitted again.

asr-001134
01:21:41.840 --> 01:21:43.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. Chair, I would like to...

asr-001135
01:21:43.060 --> 01:21:45.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What's the name of the DBM?

asr-001136
01:21:45.280 --> 01:21:46.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Oh, yeah, please.

asr-001137
01:21:46.300 --> 01:21:46.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With your indulgence.

asr-001138
01:21:46.820 --> 01:21:47.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With your indulgence.

asr-001139
01:21:47.820 --> 01:21:57.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, some things, the Manila Hall of Justice proposal, what are the causes of delays?

asr-001140
01:21:57.540 --> 01:22:07.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'd just like to ask that the Hall of Justice in Manila is again delayed because the 1.918

asr-001141
01:22:07.040 --> 01:22:12.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: billion second year funding, supposedly, for the Manila Hall of Justice.

asr-001142
01:22:12.480 --> 01:22:15.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, what are the causes of delays?

asr-001143
01:22:15.280 --> 01:22:18.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: When do you expect the construction to resume?

asr-001144
01:22:18.860 --> 01:22:19.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's what I mentioned earlier.

asr-001145
01:22:20.100 --> 01:22:23.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, what are the bottlenecks?

asr-001146
01:22:23.500 --> 01:22:28.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And I think this is more than 26 years overdue now, or 20...

asr-001147
01:22:28.660 --> 01:22:31.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's right, 30 years already.

asr-001148
01:22:32.140 --> 01:22:37.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Justice Lopez said, 1992, when the first groundbreaking took place.

asr-001149
01:22:38.160 --> 01:22:38.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, go ahead, ma'am.

asr-001150
01:22:39.860 --> 01:22:41.280
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001151
01:22:41.280 --> 01:22:43.280
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Mr. Chair, the Department of Budget and Management has already...

asr-001152
01:22:43.280 --> 01:22:44.160
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The Department of Budget and Management has already...

asr-001153
01:22:44.160 --> 01:22:45.160
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The Department of Budget and Management has already...

asr-001154
01:22:45.160 --> 01:22:50.000
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Submitted its comment, but for the record, we have not yet received, formally received

asr-001155
01:22:50.000 --> 01:22:50.800
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: a copy of the same.

asr-001156
01:22:50.860 --> 01:22:52.180
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So, we have not even read it.

asr-001157
01:22:52.460 --> 01:22:57.400
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: But to answer your honor's question, your honor, on what caused the delay in the Manila

asr-001158
01:22:57.400 --> 01:23:04.120
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Hall of Justice project, your honor, I do know that there was already an awarded contractor

asr-001159
01:23:04.120 --> 01:23:07.340
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: way back in, before I...

asr-001160
01:23:07.340 --> 01:23:12.900
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: I was still an art regional trial court judge, your honor, but it was complicated by a technical

asr-001161
01:23:12.900 --> 01:23:15.140
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: mathematical computation, your honor.

asr-001162
01:23:15.140 --> 01:23:24.860
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Which way, the honorable Supreme Court had to terminate the contractor, the works that

asr-001163
01:23:24.860 --> 01:23:31.360
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: was already procured because of that error.

asr-001164
01:23:32.480 --> 01:23:36.980
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So, the diet consultant was terminated, and then we had to repost it again.

asr-001165
01:23:37.080 --> 01:23:38.500
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We had two failed biddings.

asr-001166
01:23:38.500 --> 01:23:44.500
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: And then now, it was only the second semester of 2024 that a consulting certifying...

asr-001167
01:23:45.140 --> 01:23:49.800
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: was engaged and is about to submit the DAED, Your Honor.

asr-001168
01:23:50.260 --> 01:23:54.560
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So it is not an ordinary construction project, Your Honor.

asr-001169
01:23:54.680 --> 01:23:59.060
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: So we really have to make it ready, especially make it disaster resilient

asr-001170
01:23:59.060 --> 01:24:02.240
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: with all the natural calamities that we are experiencing.

asr-001171
01:24:02.600 --> 01:24:05.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So may pag-asa pa naman na before matapos ang term is NKCO ulit.

asr-001172
01:24:05.980 --> 01:24:06.880
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes po, sana po.

asr-001173
01:24:06.880 --> 01:24:11.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At yung bago mag-retirement na si Associate Justice Joseph Lopez,

asr-001174
01:24:11.960 --> 01:24:15.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: may tayo na itong Manila Hall of Justice.

asr-001175
01:24:15.800 --> 01:24:16.480
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001176
01:24:16.880 --> 01:24:17.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sana naman, no?

asr-001177
01:24:17.720 --> 01:24:26.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We know we have a very limited fiscal space, but I think Manila is our capital.

asr-001178
01:24:26.620 --> 01:24:28.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi naman natin pwede pabayaan.

asr-001179
01:24:28.360 --> 01:24:29.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tama kayo kanina sa Mr. Chair.

asr-001180
01:24:29.960 --> 01:24:32.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May Manila and then Cebu and then Cagandioro, no?

asr-001181
01:24:32.820 --> 01:24:33.100
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Opo.

asr-001182
01:24:33.100 --> 01:24:38.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, and then also, next is yung pong acquisition.

asr-001183
01:24:38.560 --> 01:24:41.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron pa silang ano na, para lang alam nyo po yung selector,

asr-001184
01:24:41.760 --> 01:24:41.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nandito.

asr-001185
01:24:41.960 --> 01:24:49.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Noted that the court is asking for a 314 million for the acquisition of 100 units of motor vehicles.

asr-001186
01:24:50.320 --> 01:24:56.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, may we know how many of the 100 units will be allotted to the courts?

asr-001187
01:24:56.420 --> 01:24:57.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Or paano pong paggagamit nito?

asr-001188
01:24:58.440 --> 01:25:06.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For what I know kasi, swerte na Mr. Chair kasi yung yung mga more affluent LGUs, no?

asr-001189
01:25:06.440 --> 01:25:08.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They support the improvement of the courts.

asr-001190
01:25:08.100 --> 01:25:11.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They provide the vehicles to the judges.

asr-001191
01:25:11.960 --> 01:25:15.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And the other needs of the courts and some personnel.

asr-001192
01:25:16.980 --> 01:25:24.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ito po ang, ito po ang, so what is the distribution of the 100 units?

asr-001193
01:25:25.620 --> 01:25:33.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi pinapanon na, they also note, they also mentioned ito pong request the 300 million for vehicles.

asr-001194
01:25:37.020 --> 01:25:38.840
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-001195
01:25:38.840 --> 01:25:40.840
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Your Honor, specifically.

asr-001196
01:25:40.840 --> 01:25:45.300
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Specifically, for Supreme Court lang ito.

asr-001197
01:25:45.920 --> 01:25:49.780
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We can, Your Honor, I do not have the data for all courts.

asr-001198
01:25:49.900 --> 01:25:51.380
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Can we just submit the same, Your Honor?

asr-001199
01:25:51.900 --> 01:25:52.240
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, please.

asr-001200
01:25:52.500 --> 01:26:00.640
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: But basically, the 340 vehicle acquisition will be part of the reflating program of the Supreme Court, Your Honor.

asr-001201
01:26:00.880 --> 01:26:01.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ah, it's for the Supreme Court.

asr-001202
01:26:02.040 --> 01:26:02.520
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, po.

asr-001203
01:26:02.520 --> 01:26:06.860
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Supreme Court and also the appellate courts, Your Honor.

asr-001204
01:26:07.000 --> 01:26:07.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Appellate courts, okay.

asr-001205
01:26:08.960 --> 01:26:10.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because, I know for a fact like,

asr-001206
01:26:10.840 --> 01:26:16.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Makati, the Reacher, they provide vehicles for the judges, diba?

asr-001207
01:26:16.700 --> 01:26:21.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero although hindi lahat, minsan kalahati lang, suerte-suerte yan din sa Manila.

asr-001208
01:26:21.620 --> 01:26:24.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, this one is for the Supreme Court and the appellate courts.

asr-001209
01:26:25.000 --> 01:26:31.560
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Sa lower courts po kasi, Your Honor, basically, it's through the generosity of the local government units

asr-001210
01:26:31.560 --> 01:26:34.500
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: who would provide for the service vehicles.

asr-001211
01:26:34.500 --> 01:26:39.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, I think for the cities, yung may first class municipalities, no problem.

asr-001212
01:26:39.900 --> 01:26:40.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They can support.

asr-001213
01:26:40.840 --> 01:26:41.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The courts, no?

asr-001214
01:26:42.140 --> 01:26:48.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We know for a fact kasi, our Senate President, I myself, for mayors, and we were able to establish, no?

asr-001215
01:26:48.460 --> 01:26:50.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With the, yung RTCs already.

asr-001216
01:26:50.840 --> 01:26:53.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Like, in San Juan, meron kami sarili and we support, no?

asr-001217
01:26:53.240 --> 01:27:01.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The LGU supports and I think Valenzuela and the bigger cities, especially Makati and Manila, no?

asr-001218
01:27:01.680 --> 01:27:10.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Although, yung iba kalahati-kalahati lang na po-provide nila because ang dami rin RTCs in the big major cities.

asr-001219
01:27:10.840 --> 01:27:21.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung pong programs, no, that was mentioned by our chair and our Senate President, yung tumpo to sa cold congestion at lahat

asr-001220
01:27:21.840 --> 01:27:27.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and the need for us to have a catch-up plan, so to speak, for the infrastructure.

asr-001221
01:27:27.520 --> 01:27:29.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm very much particular with that.

asr-001222
01:27:30.380 --> 01:27:36.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We're hoping that if you can provide us, sana masimula na po natin in 2027, no?

asr-001223
01:27:36.160 --> 01:27:39.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So that we can already address the problem of the backlogs, no?

asr-001224
01:27:39.680 --> 01:27:40.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya nga.

asr-001225
01:27:40.840 --> 01:27:50.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If it's digitalization, if it's computerization, and if it's a combination of both infrastructure,

asr-001226
01:27:50.320 --> 01:27:57.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kasi binabanggit niyo po yung kaninang hawak ng mga cases, of course, 5,000, 6,000, that's quite a lot, no?

asr-001227
01:27:58.580 --> 01:28:03.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, if you please let us know so that we can already start with the catch-up plan.

asr-001228
01:28:04.300 --> 01:28:07.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we cannot, ano, it was noted by our chair also.

asr-001229
01:28:08.080 --> 01:28:10.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nakung tutuusin yung 7 billion.

asr-001230
01:28:10.840 --> 01:28:15.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 7, 70 billion budget is just a drop, no?

asr-001231
01:28:15.720 --> 01:28:18.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kung pag-asa 7 trillion, 1%.

asr-001232
01:28:18.160 --> 01:28:18.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Diba?

asr-001233
01:28:19.220 --> 01:28:25.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And this is already a co-equal branch in charge of administering justice, no?

asr-001234
01:28:26.100 --> 01:28:31.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yun po, can you provide us in case yung pong catch-up plan nyo, if ever,

asr-001235
01:28:31.640 --> 01:28:34.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so that we can address these problems of the backlogs already?

asr-001236
01:28:34.700 --> 01:28:40.500
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We will work on it, Your Honor, because we have our own Statistics Records Division in the Supreme Court,

asr-001237
01:28:40.500 --> 01:28:41.540
