Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ng pondo, Chairman. Baka

asr-001680
01:45:00.340 --> 01:45:02.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How do you explain that, if I may?

asr-001681
01:45:02.980 --> 01:45:08.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How do you explain the jump from 39% to 82%?

asr-001682
01:45:08.040 --> 01:45:16.960
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: There are varying factors of the disparity, the range in conviction rate.

asr-001683
01:45:17.500 --> 01:45:22.640
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Among others would be probably in the preparation of the prosecutors.

asr-001684
01:45:23.660 --> 01:45:28.460
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Maybe the prosecutors have prepared themselves and presented their cases.

asr-001685
01:45:28.460 --> 01:45:41.860
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Also, Your Honor, one of the most important factors is when we try the cases sooner, the witnesses are available and the prosecution is prepared.

asr-001686
01:45:42.400 --> 01:45:50.280
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: The memory of the witnesses is very fresh, and therefore they can tell the court what really happened.

asr-001687
