Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The risk of witnesses being…

asr-001689
01:46:02.720 --> 01:46:03.460
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: They die.

asr-001690
01:46:03.600 --> 01:46:04.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They die or they're…

asr-001691
01:46:04.540 --> 01:46:05.200
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Unavailable.

asr-001692
01:46:05.560 --> 01:46:07.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Or they become pressured by whatever, no?

asr-001693
01:46:08.040 --> 01:46:08.680
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001694
01:46:08.700 --> 01:46:09.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Outside extraneous…

asr-001695
01:46:10.260 --> 01:46:11.000
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001696
01:46:11.100 --> 01:46:14.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So the quicker, the faster, the easier the conviction.

asr-001697
01:46:14.440 --> 01:46:15.360
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001698
01:46:15.480 --> 01:46:24.240
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: That's why the Sandigan Bayan is actually pushing for speedy disposition of cases, especially the cases that are recently filed.

asr-001699
01:46:25.600 --> 01:46:28.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. Chairman, Mr. President…

asr-001700
01:46:28.460 --> 01:46:41.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, with your indulgence, especially right now, with the recent biggest corruption issue in history of our government, which happened last year in flood control, people are enraged.

asr-001701
01:46:41.540 --> 01:46:58.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And people are waiting for actions, and they think in our quest for accountability, and we are instituting reforms so that we would like to practice transparency.

asr-001702
01:46:58.460 --> 01:47:03.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because we want to bring back the trust of people in government.

asr-001703
01:47:03.260 --> 01:47:13.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ma'am, we are banking on the Sandigan Bayan, siguro, but it's very important, especially in a fight against corruption, is yung pong certainty of punishment, no?

asr-001704
01:47:14.060 --> 01:47:21.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, sabi ni Mr. Chairman, pag tumatagal, nawawala na yung mga witness, tapos yung mga justice inaabutan retirement.

asr-001705
01:47:21.540 --> 01:47:23.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, we will be…

asr-001706
01:47:23.540 --> 01:47:27.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We are doing our part also in the Senate, no?

asr-001707
01:47:27.420 --> 01:47:27.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: By…

asr-001708
01:47:28.460 --> 01:47:32.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: By instituting reforms, by instituting transparency.

asr-001709
01:47:33.680 --> 01:47:35.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We're hoping that we can…

asr-001710
01:47:35.820 --> 01:47:57.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Whatever support we can give sa Sandigan po, yung budget niyo na kung kinakilay augment or improve so that, you know, it's very crucial at this point in our history that yung pong certainty of punishment and speedy disposition of justice is very crucial.

asr-001711
01:47:57.200 --> 01:47:58.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In our fight against…

asr-001712
01:47:58.460 --> 01:48:05.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And for our request to reform the government.

asr-001713
01:48:05.440 --> 01:48:05.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, ma'am.

asr-001714
01:48:06.080 --> 01:48:06.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001715
01:48:06.760 --> 01:48:22.320
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Just to inform the senators, of the flood control cases that were filed, the first of the flood control case that was filed by the Honorable Ombudsman was in November 18, 2025.

asr-001716
01:48:23.320 --> 01:48:28.440
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Of the first cases that were filed, they are already in the defense stage.

asr-001717
01:48:28.460 --> 01:48:36.940
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: That means that in less than a year, we are already in the defense side.

asr-001718
01:48:38.620 --> 01:48:40.580
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: So, that's pretty fast po.

asr-001719
01:48:42.040 --> 01:48:46.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How many flood control cases have been filed already to the Sandigan?

asr-001720
01:48:46.700 --> 01:48:52.900
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: As of today, there are 26 cases that were filed by the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001721
01:48:53.860 --> 01:48:54.880
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: 26 po.

asr-001722
01:48:54.880 --> 01:48:57.880
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Against senators and against…

asr-001723
01:48:58.460 --> 01:49:00.180
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Against congressmen.

asr-001724
01:49:01.800 --> 01:49:10.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Out of the 26 cases, you mentioned that some of them are already in the defense stage.

asr-001725
01:49:10.440 --> 01:49:12.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ilan po ang nasa defense stage na?

asr-001726
01:49:12.960 --> 01:49:13.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: More or less lang.

asr-001727
01:49:13.740 --> 01:49:17.640
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: The earliest that was filed is already in the defense stage.

asr-001728
01:49:21.580 --> 01:49:26.740
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: One was archived because the accused was…

asr-001729
01:49:26.740 --> 01:49:27.740
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Was…

asr-001730
01:49:28.460 --> 01:49:29.460
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Well, could not be located.

asr-001731
01:49:30.340 --> 01:49:37.060
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And the other cases that had co-accused is already in that defense stage already.

asr-001732
01:49:37.480 --> 01:49:37.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-001733
01:49:38.540 --> 01:49:44.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, we'll see a resolution on that particular case quite soon?

asr-001734
01:49:44.500 --> 01:49:59.880
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: If we follow the Speedy Trial Act that was enacted by the Supreme Court, we will see the conviction within a year…

asr-001735
01:49:59.880 --> 01:50:00.500
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: The year po.

asr-001736
01:50:01.680 --> 01:50:03.780
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Or acquittal within the year.

asr-001737
01:50:03.860 --> 01:50:04.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or acquittal, of course.

asr-001738
01:50:08.280 --> 01:50:16.180
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Well, the disposition within the year, which may be a conviction or acquittal.

asr-001739
01:50:16.180 --> 01:50:20.430
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We're not going to say what our preference is.

asr-001740
01:50:22.210 --> 01:50:31.170
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But connected to this, Justice, I actually was doing some research.

asr-001741
01:50:31.870 --> 01:50:32.590
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: There's this…

asr-001742
01:50:32.590 --> 01:50:33.590
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: There's this…

asr-001743
01:50:33.590 --> 01:50:33.630
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: There's this…

asr-001744
01:50:33.630 --> 01:50:38.010
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: There's this matrix called the Corruption Perceptions Index.

asr-001745
01:50:38.390 --> 01:50:38.830
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Yes, po.

asr-001746
01:50:38.830 --> 01:50:45.770
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In which, noong 2001, we're actually ranked 117, 117.

asr-001747
01:50:46.350 --> 01:50:52.650
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And in 2025, bumagsak tayo to rank 120.

asr-001748
01:50:53.530 --> 01:51:01.190
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We're only higher than Myanmar and Cambodia, which are military junta regimes.

asr-001749
01:51:01.190 --> 01:51:03.190
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words…

asr-001750
01:51:03.630 --> 01:51:16.390
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The perception of our international peers, mga kasamahan na natin sa ibang bansa, is lumalalaing corruption sa atin.

asr-001751
01:51:16.390 --> 01:51:21.990
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And that also is connected to investments in our country.

asr-001752
01:51:22.090 --> 01:51:24.050
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's why I saw numbers in our investments.

asr-001753
01:51:24.250 --> 01:51:26.270
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's also gone down.

asr-001754
01:51:27.390 --> 01:51:32.850
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Lately, the Business Confidence Index by local businessmen has plunged to a negative.

asr-001755
01:51:32.850 --> 01:51:38.050
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Territory, which is actually even worse than the pandemic time.

asr-001756
01:51:38.330 --> 01:51:45.350
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, the perception of corruption, and also government addressing it, is quite low.

asr-001757
01:51:45.650 --> 01:51:54.750
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I just want to ask the Sandigan, how are we also addressing this perception of corruption?

asr-001758
01:51:54.750 --> 01:52:02.690
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: As well as, how is the Sandigan also working with the other branches of government?

asr-001759
01:52:02.690 --> 01:52:08.830
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: To improve our perception of corruption, and eventually make people accountable.

asr-001760
01:52:09.050 --> 01:52:14.310
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At the end of the day, ang gusto naman natin kung ang evident siya, claro, then let's make people accountable.

asr-001761
01:52:14.930 --> 01:52:22.450
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, and like I said, the executive, legislative, and judiciary, in the eyes of our kababayan, isa lang yan eh.

asr-001762
01:52:22.850 --> 01:52:24.030
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: One government lang.

asr-001763
01:52:24.210 --> 01:52:28.770
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, we want to ask, and right now is a crucial time because of the corruption issue.

asr-001764
01:52:28.770 --> 01:52:30.350
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I want to ask the Sandigan.

asr-001765
01:52:31.170 --> 01:52:32.250
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How are we?

asr-001766
01:52:32.690 --> 01:52:46.050
