asr-001767
01:52:49.310 --> 01:52:50.890
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Thank you, Mr. Senate President.

asr-001768
01:52:50.890 --> 01:53:01.790
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Actually, this Corruption Perception Index is a report of Transparency International, an NGO, an international NGO.

asr-001769
01:53:02.130 --> 01:53:04.010
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And there are several parameters.

asr-001770
01:53:04.010 --> 01:53:13.330
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: That are being considered in rating a country in terms of its performance vis-a-vis corruption.

asr-001771
01:53:14.990 --> 01:53:18.490
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: The judiciary certainly plays a role.

asr-001772
01:53:19.090 --> 01:53:25.810
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: But it is only a specific portion that it can address.

asr-001773
01:53:25.810 --> 01:53:30.770
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And that is in the speedy disposition of cases, one.

asr-001774
01:53:31.770 --> 01:53:33.810
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Two, that the justices.

asr-001775
01:53:34.010 --> 01:53:41.490
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And the court system must appear to be credible that it is dispensing justice.

asr-001776
01:53:42.590 --> 01:53:54.490
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Important is this credibility of the justice system and the judges, justices, that we can be fair in the decisions that we give.

asr-001777
01:53:56.230 --> 01:54:03.990
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And I think the Supreme Court is stressing the need for the justices and the judges to be credible.

asr-001780
01:54:05.030 --> 01:54:11.310
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: It is very strong now, the Supreme Court, especially under the Chief Justice, SPJI.

asr-001781
01:54:12.310 --> 01:54:15.230
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: That the judges should also be ethical.

asr-001782
01:54:15.790 --> 01:54:23.410
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: And that we maintain our values as citizens and as judges.

asr-001783
01:54:24.550 --> 01:54:26.850
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Once we are credible enough.

asr-001784
01:54:27.090 --> 01:54:33.050
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Once the people will have faith and the Filipino citizen will have faith that we can deliver.

asr-001785
01:54:34.010 --> 01:54:38.410
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: and give that justice to the Filipino citizens,

asr-001786
01:54:39.230 --> 01:54:45.810
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: then perception of justice and non-corruption will increase.

asr-001787
01:54:47.030 --> 01:54:54.290
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: The step forward for us in the Sandigan Bayan is to ensure that when cases are filed,

asr-001788
01:54:55.110 --> 01:54:59.810
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: we attend to the cases and that they are heard immediately.

asr-001789
01:54:59.810 --> 01:55:07.930
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Thus, right now in the Sandigan Bayan, everybody, it is open in the internet.

asr-001790
01:55:08.790 --> 01:55:12.430
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: You can see where the cases are ruffled to.

asr-001791
01:55:13.350 --> 01:55:21.770
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Even our ruffle of cases is open to the public and it is aired via internet.

asr-001792
01:55:22.650 --> 01:55:27.430
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Our hearings in the Sandigan Bayan are also made accessible.

asr-001793
01:55:27.430 --> 01:55:33.910
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: People can listen to the actual hearings conducted

asr-001794
01:55:33.910 --> 01:55:41.570
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: so that the people can judge for themselves whether we are biased or not.

asr-001795
01:55:42.390 --> 01:55:49.490
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: So these are our steps to make sure that we are transparent in what we do.

asr-001796
01:55:53.860 --> 01:56:00.160
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: Internally, we have also made sure that we do not go beyond the period set

asr-001797
01:56:00.160 --> 01:56:04.180
Sandiganbayan Presiding Justice Geraldine Faith Econg: by the Supreme Court to render decisions.

asr-001798
01:56:05.280 --> 01:56:10.120
