Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yung kaninang ano po?

asr-002649
02:35:48.260 --> 02:35:49.620
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: 3,000.

asr-002650
02:35:50.780 --> 02:35:56.100
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We have a total of 2,885 courts po.

asr-002651
