asr-002653
02:36:01.520 --> 02:36:04.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But there are 489 vacancies.

asr-002654
02:36:05.000 --> 02:36:08.860
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: I cannot do my math po, but that represents a percentage of...

asr-002655
02:36:08.860 --> 02:36:14.040
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: 2,885 divided by...

asr-002656
02:36:14.040 --> 02:36:15.380
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: 489.

asr-002657
02:36:15.940 --> 02:36:17.340
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: 18% your honor.

asr-002658
02:36:17.580 --> 02:36:18.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 18% only.

asr-002659
02:36:20.080 --> 02:36:20.580
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes po.

asr-002660
02:36:21.080 --> 02:36:24.600
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Kasi po madali naman po talaga silang mapunan, ma-filled up.

asr-002661
02:36:24.600 --> 02:36:26.560
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The JBS is very active on it.

asr-002662
02:36:26.860 --> 02:36:29.260
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: The Promotions Selection Board of the...

asr-002663
02:36:29.260 --> 02:36:32.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fact, it's low compared to previous years.

asr-002664
02:36:32.600 --> 02:36:33.160
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes po.

asr-002665
02:36:35.080 --> 02:36:38.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I remember when I was with the JBC for that eight-year period,

asr-002666
02:36:39.100 --> 02:36:42.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: we were able to bring it down from 32% to 16%.

asr-002667
02:36:42.660 --> 02:36:45.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We slashed it in half.

asr-002668
02:36:46.400 --> 02:36:50.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that meant the JBC was interviewing lawyers,

asr-002669
02:36:51.280 --> 02:36:52.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 30 lawyers every day.

asr-002670
02:36:53.280 --> 02:36:55.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: To fill that up.

asr-002671
02:36:55.120 --> 02:36:56.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So now it's...

asr-002672
02:36:56.860 --> 02:36:57.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 18%.

asr-002673
02:36:57.460 --> 02:36:58.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that's...

asr-002674
02:36:58.520 --> 02:37:02.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Maybe we should push the JBC.

asr-002675
02:37:02.580 --> 02:37:03.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Of course, I'm there.

asr-002676
02:37:04.900 --> 02:37:08.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: To bring it down to single digit.

asr-002677
02:37:08.540 --> 02:37:09.180
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes your honor.

asr-002678
02:37:09.340 --> 02:37:10.340
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: That's the goal, your honor.

asr-002679
02:37:10.500 --> 02:37:10.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yeah.

asr-002680
02:37:10.960 --> 02:37:11.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002681
02:37:11.780 --> 02:37:11.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sige.

asr-002682
02:37:12.180 --> 02:37:18.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So anyway, if you can submit it in writing so that we can be able to defend it on the floor.

asr-002683
02:37:18.820 --> 02:37:20.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Should there be any questions?

asr-002684
02:37:20.520 --> 02:37:20.980
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, sir.

asr-002685
02:37:21.840 --> 02:37:22.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I guess...

asr-002686
02:37:23.480 --> 02:37:24.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Vacancies.

asr-002687
02:37:26.750 --> 02:37:27.350
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002688
02:37:28.030 --> 02:37:28.730
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oh, there you go.

asr-002689
02:37:29.350 --> 02:37:30.070
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yeah.

asr-002690
02:37:30.550 --> 02:37:30.810
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sige.

asr-002691
02:37:31.410 --> 02:37:38.150
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung unfilled positions and how do we reconcile it with additional funding for newly...

asr-002692
02:37:38.150 --> 02:37:39.710
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For positions to be created.

asr-002693
02:37:41.310 --> 02:37:42.030
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002694
02:37:42.590 --> 02:37:44.550
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, I have no other questions.

asr-002695
02:37:45.510 --> 02:37:52.810
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Maybe just the concern that for your fiscal autonomy act,

asr-002696
02:37:53.430 --> 02:37:54.650
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: that you still...

asr-002697
02:37:54.650 --> 02:37:57.990
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You are still in the process of finalizing the IRR, no?

asr-002698
02:37:57.990 --> 02:37:58.590
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that...

asr-002699
02:37:58.750 --> 02:37:58.990
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yeah.

asr-002700
02:37:59.650 --> 02:38:03.950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So as soon as that is available or ready, please inform us, no?

asr-002701
02:38:04.130 --> 02:38:06.050
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: We will do that, Your Honor, Mr.

asr-002702
02:38:06.050 --> 02:38:06.170
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-002703
02:38:06.630 --> 02:38:06.950
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002704
02:38:10.060 --> 02:38:10.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002705
02:38:12.560 --> 02:38:17.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And then there will be a transition from the JDF to the trust fund, no?

asr-002706
02:38:17.380 --> 02:38:17.960
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, your honor.

asr-002707
02:38:18.560 --> 02:38:18.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Right?

asr-002708
02:38:19.040 --> 02:38:19.680
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, your honor.

asr-002709
02:38:19.700 --> 02:38:20.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Also because of the law.

asr-002710
02:38:21.200 --> 02:38:21.860
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, your honor.

asr-002711
02:38:22.400 --> 02:38:26.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And how do you look at the transition?

asr-002712
02:38:26.140 --> 02:38:29.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Will that be completed within this year or...?

asr-002713
02:38:29.660 --> 02:38:31.320
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Yes, it's in the IRR, your honor.

asr-002714
02:38:31.500 --> 02:38:36.780
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: On the 80-20% that is provided for in the Judiciary Development Fund,

asr-002715
02:38:37.000 --> 02:38:40.740
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: we'll have a big change in so far as the Judiciary Trust Fund is concerned.

asr-002716
02:38:40.740 --> 02:38:44.000
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: But not until the IRR is issued, your honor.

asr-002717
02:38:44.320 --> 02:38:48.180
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: That's the only time we can share how we plan to go about it.

asr-002718
02:38:48.280 --> 02:38:48.880
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: Thank you, your honor.

asr-002719
02:38:49.500 --> 02:38:49.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the...

asr-002720
02:38:50.660 --> 02:38:55.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Is it correct that the JDF right now stands at how much?

asr-002721
02:38:57.240 --> 02:38:59.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's 18 billion, is it correct?

asr-002722
02:39:00.000 --> 02:39:00.280
Court Administrator Theresa Dolores Gomez-Estoesta: 18.

asr-002723
02:39:00.280 --> 02:39:08.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Of course, that is 26 billion and disbursement of 23 billion.

asr-002724
02:39:08.720 --> 02:39:11.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But this is a period of almost 20 years.

asr-002725
02:39:13.000 --> 02:39:13.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So we'll just...

asr-002726
02:39:13.860 --> 02:39:16.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Anyway, I really don't have much.

asr-002727
02:39:17.860 --> 02:39:19.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Just one more, one more question.

asr-002728
02:39:19.980 --> 02:39:20.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: This is for the CTA.

asr-002729
02:39:23.120 --> 02:39:29.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The Law on Anti-Agriculture Economic Sabotage Act.

asr-002730
02:39:30.280 --> 02:39:34.080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That the CTA has primary jurisdiction.

asr-002731
02:39:35.800 --> 02:39:40.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the complaint has always been that there is no smuggler.

asr-002732
02:39:40.280 --> 02:39:48.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Anti-economic sabotage is a non-bailable offense.

asr-002733
02:39:49.960 --> 02:39:57.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And they have announced billions of confiscations.

asr-002734
02:40:00.280 --> 02:40:05.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They have 4 billion, 500 million, cigarellos.

asr-002735
02:40:05.880 --> 02:40:11.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the non-bailable amount is 10 million.

asr-002736
02:40:13.700 --> 02:40:19.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, but interesting enough, despite the confiscation of billions,

asr-002737
02:40:21.280 --> 02:40:24.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: there is no smuggler who is still in prison.

asr-002738
02:40:26.100 --> 02:40:27.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For the value of 10 million.

asr-002739
02:40:28.460 --> 02:40:30.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So you have all these public pronouncements.

asr-002740
02:40:31.280 --> 02:40:31.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Of course, this is...

asr-002741
02:40:31.880 --> 02:40:36.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The whole, you know, the whole slew of the cooperation of the BOC,

asr-002742
02:40:36.880 --> 02:40:40.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: the cooperation of the DOJ, et cetera, prosecution, et cetera,

asr-002743
02:40:41.060 --> 02:40:42.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: to be able to do this.

asr-002744
02:40:43.080 --> 02:40:48.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But, you know, it's strange that the public announcements are so...

asr-002745
02:40:49.080 --> 02:40:51.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Are in the billions, hundreds of millions.

asr-002746
02:40:51.840 --> 02:40:57.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But when it boils down to prosecution, no one is being jailed.

asr-002747
02:40:57.880 --> 02:40:58.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But there is no...

asr-002748
02:40:58.920 --> 02:41:00.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: There is no non-bailable...

asr-002749
02:41:01.880 --> 02:41:07.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Offense where the masterminds, you know, are...

asr-002750
02:41:07.860 --> 02:41:09.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: There are those who have been jailed.

asr-002751
02:41:09.180 --> 02:41:12.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: A bodeguero, something like that.

asr-002752
02:41:13.840 --> 02:41:16.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But anyway, my concern really is,

asr-002753
02:41:17.300 --> 02:41:23.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: what support do you need to be able to achieve the mandate of the Republic Act,

asr-002754
02:41:23.260 --> 02:41:24.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: of which you have primary jurisdiction?

asr-002755
02:41:25.400 --> 02:41:26.740
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: Okay, good morning, Your Honors.

asr-002756
02:41:27.240 --> 02:41:31.780
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: First, Your Honor, I would like to give the picture that we have now in the city,

asr-002757
02:41:31.880 --> 02:41:37.800
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: the law that we are talking about is Republic Act 12022,

asr-002758
02:41:38.100 --> 02:41:41.680
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: and this was made effective last October 2025.

asr-002759
02:41:42.620 --> 02:41:47.320
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: And so far, there are about 16 cases pending hearing before our courts.

asr-002760
02:41:47.940 --> 02:41:54.200
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: And the first case filed is due for promulgation of the decision this October.

asr-002761
02:41:54.780 --> 02:41:59.920
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: So I agree that there is yet no conviction because the cases were filed.

asr-002762
02:41:59.920 --> 02:42:00.920
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: The first case was...

asr-002763
02:42:01.880 --> 02:42:04.500
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: The first case filed was in March 2026.

asr-002764
02:42:05.260 --> 02:42:10.300
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: So that case will have its promulgation of the decision this October.

asr-002765
02:42:11.680 --> 02:42:13.960
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: And as for those...

asr-002766
02:42:13.960 --> 02:42:19.360
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: This is indeed a non-bailable offense for an amount exceeding 10 million,

asr-002767
02:42:19.540 --> 02:42:22.440
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: and we have denied petitions for bail,

asr-002768
02:42:22.580 --> 02:42:26.200
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: and there are presently incarcerated, Your Honor.

asr-002769
02:42:26.200 --> 02:42:31.930
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: Thank you.

asr-002770
02:42:33.530 --> 02:42:35.870
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The driver...

asr-002771
02:42:36.550 --> 02:42:38.790
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-002772
02:42:38.850 --> 02:42:45.250
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: There are indeed drivers and passengers who are also included in the information.

asr-002773
02:42:45.910 --> 02:42:50.210
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: But in the cases that we have been hearing, at least in our division,

asr-002774
02:42:51.030 --> 02:42:55.970
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: the supposed importer or the owner are also presently detained.

asr-002775
02:42:56.490 --> 02:42:57.250
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, okay.

asr-002776
02:42:57.810 --> 02:43:00.130
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I don't want you to go into the merits of the case,

asr-002777
02:43:00.130 --> 02:43:05.110
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: but it's enough to know that that's the status of the case.

asr-002778
02:43:05.110 --> 02:43:06.670
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And we hope there'll be more.

asr-002779
02:43:13.160 --> 02:43:13.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oh, yeah.

asr-002780
02:43:14.120 --> 02:43:17.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the establishment of your courts in the Visayas and Mindanao,

asr-002781
02:43:17.940 --> 02:43:18.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: is that...

asr-002782
02:43:18.620 --> 02:43:19.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How is that...

asr-002783
02:43:21.060 --> 02:43:22.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Under the law, you have...

asr-002784
02:43:22.940 --> 02:43:24.700
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: Under the law, yes, Senator.

asr-002785
02:43:24.960 --> 02:43:33.540
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: There is that provision in the law that allows us to create new courts in the Visayas and also in Mindanao.

asr-002786
02:43:33.540 --> 02:43:37.480
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: But so far, with the number of cases that we have been receiving,

asr-002787
02:43:37.800 --> 02:43:40.100
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: for our discussion last NBank,

asr-002788
02:43:40.100 --> 02:43:47.000
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: we are not really pushing it this time because of the minimal number of cases being filed.

asr-002789
02:43:48.140 --> 02:43:48.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yeah.

asr-002790
02:43:48.660 --> 02:43:56.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, I just wanted this on record so that to inform also our justices and our judges.

asr-002791
02:43:58.000 --> 02:44:07.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You know, agriculture smuggling is killing the local farming and fishing sector.

asr-002792
02:44:07.800 --> 02:44:10.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And our food security is compromised.

asr-002793
02:44:10.520 --> 02:44:12.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Not just food security, food safety.

asr-002794
02:44:13.500 --> 02:44:22.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Because what we are hearing is what are meant to be condemned in China are smuggled here,

asr-002795
02:44:23.540 --> 02:44:30.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: washed with formalin, and then brought into the wet markets.

asr-002796
02:44:31.920 --> 02:44:35.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So this is yung salvage value.

asr-002797
02:44:35.400 --> 02:44:37.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Bibili ng patapon nang mura,

asr-002798
02:44:37.260 --> 02:44:37.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: tapos

asr-002799
02:44:37.780 --> 02:44:42.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ibebenta dito nang mataas na presyo.

asr-002800
02:44:43.040 --> 02:44:48.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that's not just a health risk.

asr-002801
02:44:49.060 --> 02:44:52.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's also undermines our food security.

asr-002802
02:44:53.520 --> 02:44:59.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pag walang kalaban-laban yung mga magsasaka natin sa presyo na pinapasok,

asr-002803
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:18.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: hindi na nga tiyak yung kaligtasan mo, 'di ba? Tapos pinapatay pa yung local na industry. That's why smuggling of agricultural products is something that we really have to go hammer and tongs in addressing.

asr-002804
02:45:18.640 --> 02:45:20.100
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: I agree, Your Honor.

asr-002805
02:45:20.100 --> 02:45:30.820
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: And I would like also to share that we have already drafted our own rules insofar as the application of search warrants and seizure orders from these smuggled goods.

asr-002806
02:45:31.480 --> 02:45:39.900
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: So this was made effective last July 1, so just barely eight months after the promulgation or the enactment of the law.

asr-002807
02:45:40.060 --> 02:45:47.220
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: So this is already in place to facilitate the easier filing of the search warrants and SOs before the CTA.

asr-002808
02:45:47.220 --> 02:45:49.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And in our anti-smuggling activity.

asr-002809
02:45:50.100 --> 02:45:52.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Agri-smuggling hearings in the Committee on Agriculture.

asr-002810
02:45:54.120 --> 02:46:04.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You know, in the last three years, the biggest, the billion peso importer of rice, you know, who was given the necessary permits.

asr-002811
02:46:05.220 --> 02:46:07.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Five of them were able to import.

asr-002812
02:46:08.700 --> 02:46:12.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They were the largest and their addresses were the same street.

asr-002813
02:46:15.960 --> 02:46:19.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the corporate secretary of one was a.

asr-002814
02:46:20.100 --> 02:46:21.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Married to a jeepney driver.

asr-002815
02:46:22.440 --> 02:46:25.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The corporate secretary of the other one was.

asr-002816
02:46:27.120 --> 02:46:29.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Was the wife of the jeepney driver.

asr-002817
02:46:30.760 --> 02:46:33.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You know, it's, you know, it's really.

asr-002818
02:46:33.560 --> 02:46:44.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that's why the anti-corruption, that's why 10 million non-bailable is critical in terms of enforcement so that.

asr-002819
02:46:48.180 --> 02:46:50.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But anyway.

asr-002820
02:46:50.100 --> 02:46:58.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Having said that, whatever the CTA needs in terms of support, if we can augment your budgets, we will do so.

asr-002821
02:46:59.280 --> 02:47:05.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that we can fight smuggling and ensure our food security.

asr-002822
02:47:06.060 --> 02:47:06.840
CTA Associate Justice Jean Marie A. Bacorro-Villena: Thank you, Senator.

asr-002823
02:47:07.140 --> 02:47:09.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Are there other questions from our.

asr-002824
02:47:13.040 --> 02:47:13.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-002825
02:47:14.000 --> 02:47:14.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-002826
02:47:14.560 --> 02:47:16.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So there being no other questions, there's a motion.

